{"title":"Dune Sandlord","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (5.2% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>92</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>106</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>59</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>92</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=51\" title=\"Pick level 51\"><td><b>51</b></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>106</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>59</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-sandlord\" data-map-level=\"50\">Show level 50 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/abcec94ff0faa74ecb5d.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/81048038864ef94443bc.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/6ba550470ec062873272.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/13723dc70710f273edfc.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/a999fbaccc26c6bac513.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Shock)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 45+ · Dragonscale armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/abcec94ff0faa74ecb5d.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 9 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 9 looted corpses, 16 recorded drops, 1,292 total, 31–158 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 56% of 9 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 24 total, 4–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">56% · 5/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 33% of 9 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 16 total, 8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 3/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-legs\" title=\"Dragonhide Legs - in 11% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab4bfdde0dada9a875e7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">11% · 1/9</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-mace\" title=\"Titanium Mace - in 11% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab2218963a9ff8a74162.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Mace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">11% · 1/9</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 11% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">11% · 1/9</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 33% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 6 total, 6 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 3/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 56% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 4 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">56% · 5/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"gold-fullhelm\" title=\"Gold Fullhelm - in 11% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/21b9749602270128bd77.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Fullhelm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">11% · 1/9</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 30 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 14 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Vanguard%20Camp\">Thak Vanguard Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-sandlord\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/sandlord-azhar\"><img src=\"data/img/abcec94ff0faa74ecb5d.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Sandlord Azhar</b><span>Lv 52</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Raider: <a href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider\">Dune Outrider</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-raider\">Dune Raider</a> <span class=\"muted\">(23)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder\">Dune Marauder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(29)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-warlord\">Dune Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher\">Dune Skirmisher</a> <span class=\"muted\">(37)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-blade\">Dune Blade</a> <span class=\"muted\">(41)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\">Dune Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/raider-high-chief\">Raider High Chief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/81048038864ef94443bc.webp\" alt=\"Dune Sandlord\"></div><h3>Dune Sandlord</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 50)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Raider</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>303</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>32</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>At